<key>PayloadDisplayName</key><string>AXON Local DNS</string>
<key>PayloadDescription</key><string>Resolve only axon.test through this Mac. Requires the trusted AXON LAN CA and the Mac hotspot. Other domains keep their current DNS.</string>
